# Forecast engine

Location: app/server/services/forecast/

Core modules (observed):
- ForecastEngine.ts — orchestrates forecasting
- DataLoaderService.ts — DB → in-memory cache
- ModernCacheService.ts — optimized in-memory cache
- AccountRegisterService.ts — register-level operations
- ReoccurrenceService.ts — recurring schedule generation and adjustments
- RegisterEntryService.ts — entry management during forecast
- LoanCalculatorService.ts — interest and amortization
- TransferService.ts — inter-register transfers
- DateTime.ts / DateTimeService.ts — date math, business rules, weekend handling (see adjust_before_if_on_weekend)
- DataPersisterService.ts — cache → DB snapshotting/persistence
- logger.ts, reoccurrenceIntervals.ts, types.ts, lib/rateLimiter.ts — supporting utilities

Tests:
- Extensive unit, integration, and regression coverage under forecast/__tests__
- Run via pnpm test:forecast and pnpm test:forecast:all (see testing.mdc)

Guidance:
- Any change to calculations should run the full forecast test suite
- Pay attention to decimal precision and bankers rounding (see app/lib/bankers-rounding.ts and tests)
- Ensure continuity across statement periods, interest accrual, and transfers (numerous regression tests exist)
